title Allocation App

component allocation-webapp as "Allocation Web App" web-application
component allocation-api as "Allocation API" service
component allocation-db as "Allocation Database" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south hr-service as "HR System" service

north -> allocation-webapp
north -> allocation-api

allocation-webapp -> allocation-api
allocation-webapp -> user-auth
allocation-api -> user-auth
allocation-api -> allocation-db
allocation-api -> hr-service
